{
  "name": "BriefVerzenden.nl – send a letter (HTTP Request)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## BriefVerzenden.nl via the HTTP Request node\n\nWorks without the community node.\n\n**1. Credential (once)**\nIn *Check Balance*, create a credential of type **Header Auth**:\n- Name: `Authorization`\n- Value: `Bearer bv_live_…` (your API key from the portal: https://www.briefverzenden.nl/zakelijk/portal#api)\n\nUse the same credential in *Send Letter*.\n\n**2. Data**\nIn *Recipient and PDF*, enter the recipient and a public HTTPS link to your PDF (A4, max. 10 MB). The address does not need to be in the PDF.\n\n**3. Note**\nEvery letter is charged to your credit balance. The `Idempotency-Key` makes sure a retry within the same execution does not send the letter twice.\n\nAPI documentation: https://www.briefverzenden.nl/zakelijk/api",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "15741ba6-03a7-45f0-a442-614e9529583d",
      "name": "Instructions",
